			"notes": "- Imported MultiLoader template for easier modloader management, now includes a Forge port with the click of a button\n- Finally added proper music fading that works this time\n- Removed memory leak and optimized for loops\n- With this, all of the major features have been added now\n\n**NOTE:** This will be the final release on GitHub, as the Modrinth project page is now approved & public.\n\n**Forge 1.20.1:** I can't seem to get a native Forge 1.20.1 working for some reason, but fortunately it *does* work with Sinytra Connector + the Fabric 1.20.1 build."
